{"slug":"e-zz-m","ar":"ع ظ م","total":128,"core":"greatness; bone","forms":[{"ar":"عَظِيم","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":120,"gloss":"The Great","word":"al-azeem","ex":{"s":83,"a":5,"p":2,"ar":["لِيَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"en":"For a tremendous Day"}},{"ar":"أَعْظَم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"greater","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":20,"p":10,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَهَاجَرُوا۟","وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","أَعْظَمُ","دَرَجَةً","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ ۚ","وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ"],"en":"The ones who have believed, emigrated and striven in the cause of Allah with their wealth and their lives are greater in rank in the sight of Allah. And it is those who are the attainers [of success]"}},{"ar":"عَظْم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"bone","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":4,"p":5,"ar":["قَالَ","رَبِّ","إِنِّى","وَهَنَ","ٱلْعَظْمُ","مِنِّى","وَٱشْتَعَلَ","ٱلرَّأْسُ","شَيْبًا","وَلَمْ","أَكُنۢ","بِدُعَآئِكَ","رَبِّ","شَقِيًّا"],"en":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed my bones have weakened, and my head has filled with white, and never have I been in my supplication to You, my Lord, unhappy"}},{"ar":"يُعَظِّمْ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":2,"gloss":"to honor, revere","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":32,"p":3,"ar":["ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَن","يُعَظِّمْ","شَعَـٰٓئِرَ","ٱللَّهِ","فَإِنَّهَا","مِن","تَقْوَى","ٱلْقُلُوبِ"],"en":"That [is so]. And whoever honors the symbols of Allah - indeed, it is from the piety of hearts"}},{"ar":"يُعْظِمْ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to make great","word":null,"ex":{"s":65,"a":5,"p":12,"ar":["ذَٰلِكَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","أَنزَلَهُۥٓ","إِلَيْكُمْ ۚ","وَمَن","يَتَّقِ","ٱللَّهَ","يُكَفِّرْ","عَنْهُ","سَيِّـَٔاتِهِۦ","وَيُعْظِمْ","لَهُۥٓ","أَجْرًا"],"en":"That is the command of Allah, which He has sent down to you; and whoever fears Allah - He will remove for him his misdeeds and make great for him his reward"}}],"surahs":[[4,15],[9,9],[2,6],[3,6],[37,6],[